  <p id="c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-family:p001:m0000" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAABAC">張融</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-family:p001:m0003" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAABAC">思光</persName>，吳郡吳人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-family:p001:m0013" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAAB">褘</persName>，晉琅邪王國郎中令。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-family:p001:m0025" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAABA">暢</persName>，宋會稽太守。</p>
